Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:10.21,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}I think it's time to blow this scene
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.21,0:00:12.50,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}Get everybody and their stuff together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:14.99,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,0)}Okay, three, two, one let's jam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.54,0:01:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out! You can't run anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.41,0:01:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.37,0:01:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up already, Abdul Hakim!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.95,0:01:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So ya wanna fight, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.91,0:01:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.20,0:02:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amigo!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.59,0:02:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How're all you 300,000 bounty hunters{\i0}\N{\i1}in the solar system doing?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.03,0:02:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's time for Big Shot, the show that\Nbrings you information about fugitives!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.73,0:03:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, well, first up for today\Nis this guy: Abdul Hakim.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.43,0:03:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's known as a serial pet thief.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.78,0:03:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This time, he snagged a test animal from\Na research facility, and is on the loose.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.42,0:03:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The good news is that he's\Nworth a whopping 8 million!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.50,0:03:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The conditions are as always.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.27,0:03:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bring him in alive to collect your reward.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.67,0:03:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you kill him,{\i0}\N{\i1}kiss your reward good-bye.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.55,0:03:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's the biggest we've had in a while.{\i0}\N{\i1}Do your best to get this guy!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.26,0:03:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How's it look?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.60,0:03:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.41,0:03:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, why does everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.53,0:03:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.56,0:03:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor? You got information?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.55,0:03:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}About Abdul Hakim.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.57,0:03:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll take it!{\i0} {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.36,0:03:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give a discount. 300.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.39,0:03:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I got his post-plastic surgery picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.32,0:03:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Too much. 20 down.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.11,0:03:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, 280. On one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.18,0:03:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.02,0:03:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sock him one.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.12,0:03:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He trampled over me. If you want,\Npunch him a dozen times.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.01,0:04:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got the goods.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.46,0:04:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This one should be something big...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.56,0:04:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, see you in six hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.36,0:04:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He had a very conspicuous suitcase.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.37,0:04:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That info's included in the deal, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.46,0:04:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, all right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.44,0:04:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was something that could{\i0}\N{\i1}carry a small woman inside.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.29,0:04:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.46,0:04:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can't really say.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.24,0:04:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The way he handled it{\i0}\N{\i1}sure didn't seem that way.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.87,0:04:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ni-lai-la!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.35,0:04:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,If you feel lethargic,\Nhave some ginseng hei-sui.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.97,0:04:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll last a week with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.82,0:05:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're tired, have sugarcane hei-sui.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.77,0:05:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You ate too much?\NThen have pineapple hei-sui.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.54,0:05:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme some lao-chu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.96,0:05:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.43,0:05:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.66,0:05:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops! {added this}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.99,0:05:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. My apologies, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.91,0:05:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I said I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.35,0:05:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What, can't say anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.61,0:05:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What? Ya pickin' a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.43,0:05:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.82,0:05:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.22,0:06:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, the loot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.60,0:06:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I overhaul this whole craft,\NI'll have some change!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.02,0:06:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll go eat Peking Duck with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.83,0:06:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,As they say, "Don't count\Nchickens before they hatch." {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.59,0:06:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I got this one nailed shut!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.05,0:06:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, give it what you got.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.82,0:06:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So all three went down?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.80,0:06:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.12,0:07:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And Hakim is around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.03,0:07:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.64,0:07:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, he doesn't even\Nknow its true value. {original: "Dammit, he doesn't even know how much that thing is really worth."}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.76,0:07:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A pet shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.04,0:07:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A shady one at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.03,0:07:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, bro, you can buy anything here on Mars.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.56,0:07:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,From guns to human lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.77,0:07:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If ya wanna know, show me what ya got.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.17,0:07:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The chain on this one is long.\NMust be the "Way of the Dragon" model. {3 frames extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.87,0:07:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you can tell?\NThat's a rare one from the '30s!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.44,0:07:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure is an antique.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.12,0:07:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Try the store called Animal Treasure\Noff of Caiphon Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.96,0:07:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll find something there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.09,0:07:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll look... but I'll decide if I\Nwant to buy it from you after I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.13,0:07:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.69,0:08:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Run out of funds changing your\Nface around too much, Hakim?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.22,0:08:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait a sec...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.59,0:08:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.07,0:08:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure are restless, changing\Nyour face around this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.87,0:08:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What the—?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.55,0:08:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it. I don't want any\Nof this business here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.52,0:08:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,All of my babies are very sensitive!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.47,0:08:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.21,0:08:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why me?! {original: "Why do I?!"}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.40,0:08:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all a misunderstanding... {original: "There seems to be some sort of misunderstanding..." Alt: "This/There must be a misunderstanding..."}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.14,0:08:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.07,0:08:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.75,0:08:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.21,0:08:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A dog? {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.46,0:08:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A Welsh Corgi. It's cute, but it's everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.05,0:08:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a particularly rare species.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.26,0:08:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And how much is it worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.63,0:08:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,With the suitcase, about this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.38,0:08:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,200K?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.34,0:08:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, 200, 200!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.72,0:09:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.03,0:09:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't like it, you take care\Nof it yourself. Like eating it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.40,0:09:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It {\i1}is{\i0} a puppy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.19,0:09:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you. Please continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.24,0:09:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess the Peking Duck\Nhas been overcooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.81,0:09:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,At least give me 300...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.36,0:09:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.47,0:09:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,280?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.34,0:09:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A no is a no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.46,0:09:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,250! {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.88,0:09:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Zero. I'll take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.61,0:09:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This again? What is it this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.05,0:09:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone! Catch my babies! Hurry! {snap to end keyframe or cover all of the audio and make the next two lines overlap?}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.97,0:09:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.85,0:09:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.89,0:09:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hakim?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.19,0:09:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,God dammit, what's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.19,0:10:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Gangway!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.82,0:10:37.99,Default - Overlap,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.99,0:10:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, dammit! {8 frames but made it 9}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.70,0:10:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell do you want?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.63,0:10:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Bounty hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.63,0:10:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Animal rights syndicate?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.75,0:11:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your story brings a tear to my eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.63,0:11:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Risking your life on a dog\Nthat's only worth 200 woolongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.35,0:11:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.43,0:11:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What I want are the 8 million woolongs\Nhanging from {\i1}your{\i0} neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.62,0:11:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.04,0:11:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.92,0:11:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.01,0:11:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuddup! I'm in a rotten mood right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.88,0:12:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There, there. Here, lemme put on a collar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.97,0:12:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,A dog instead of a duck, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.13,0:12:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about that!\NYou know anything about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.95,0:12:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. This is a Welsh Corgi.\NA total mongrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.67,0:12:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Totally?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.92,0:12:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Totally. Completely worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.01,0:12:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, this gives me a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.16,0:12:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And all this is because of this mongrel—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.31,0:12:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The dog is worthless,\Nbut the {\i1}owner{\i0} is worth something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.23,0:12:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, at least you should get\Nto know this critter well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.27,0:12:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I hate kids and critters!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.48,0:12:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They're nothing but trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.91,0:12:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I got something!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.98,0:12:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.66,0:12:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's big! {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.71,0:12:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.45,0:12:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull on the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.15,0:12:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What time is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.20,0:12:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I-It's 4 o'clock now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.25,0:12:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Two hours...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.85,0:13:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was that with Hakim? His ally?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.48,0:13:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.60,0:13:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We got no clues?\NWe have to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.89,0:13:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If {\i1}that{\i0} falls into police hands,\Nwe're in deep shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.65,0:13:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.64,0:13:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All our work will be worthless if our\Nexperiments get revealed to the public.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.58,0:13:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.36,0:13:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How much does he think we\Nput into that "data dog"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.81,0:13:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't {\i1}you{\i0} do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.90,0:13:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't your grandma teach you\Nto finish what you start?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.91,0:13:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She was dead before I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.33,0:13:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sorry to hear that. Anyway,\Nwe have the joker in our hand.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.87,0:13:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do what we planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.13,0:13:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me code name "snoop."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.41,0:13:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's me. I had some trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.23,0:13:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No big deal...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.93,0:13:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, Michael!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.50,0:13:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to postpone the meeting a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.68,0:13:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,As I said, it wasn't that big a deal...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.58,0:14:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible? Why? Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.65,0:14:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And {\i1}this{\i0} is our plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.98,0:14:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.92,0:14:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You have something you\Nwant to know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.21,0:14:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.01,0:14:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My little Peeko can answer your questions!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.47,0:14:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You have something you\Nwant to know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.68,0:14:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,See, little Peeko is telling me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.18,0:14:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,that you're looking for\Nsomeone or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.43,0:14:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, where there's this dog, there's Hakim.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.46,0:14:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing loud and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.66,0:14:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you, pooch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.99,0:14:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We must resort to the dog whistle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.64,0:14:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But that'll cause a big mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.82,0:15:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.77,0:15:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll draw attention to ourselves! {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.28,0:15:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.63,0:15:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.84,0:15:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.61,0:15:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hear anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.15,0:15:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I said before that humans can't hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.67,0:15:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.69,0:15:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so far fetched...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.70,0:15:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Will this really attract?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.51,0:15:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's moving. Something is\Nnow on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.91,0:15:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Babies, what's wrong with you guys?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.06,0:15:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.84,0:15:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It got away, Jet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.39,0:15:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hakim?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.42,0:15:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, the dog!{\i0} {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.35,0:16:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's close, it's close!\NWhat you are looking for is nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.85,0:16:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, right in front of your eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.14,0:16:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, you need to pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.98,0:16:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pay when I'm rich! {original: "I am". Could maybe do "Once I'm rich!" to lower CPS?}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.03,0:16:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.37,0:16:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddammit, what the hell is going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.71,0:16:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.00,0:16:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, very.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.92,0:16:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me... {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.60,0:16:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Outta my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.48,0:16:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.82,0:16:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hakim!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.78,0:16:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.78,0:16:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a dog, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.39,0:17:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hakim!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.59,0:17:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Spike, he's headed for Interstate 6.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.88,0:17:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Great! If he thinks he can\Noutrun me, he's welcome to try!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.14,0:17:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get too hotheaded!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.88,0:17:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What part of me is hotheaded?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.85,0:17:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.28,0:17:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is payback from earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.59,0:17:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell are you doin'?!\NThis guy is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.59,0:18:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What the—?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.22,0:18:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.06,0:18:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop that! {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.78,0:18:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit! {5.1, removed the hesitation because it's easier to time like this}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.66,0:18:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.85,0:18:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This{\i0} is why I hate critters!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.69,0:18:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amigo!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.07,0:18:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How're all you 300,000 bounty hunters{\i0}\N{\i1}in the solar system doing?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.51,0:18:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's time for Big Shot, the show that{\i0}\N{\i1}brings you information about fugitives!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.51,0:18:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, you remember Abdul Hakim{\i0}\N{\i1}who chose a rather{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.91,0:18:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}flashy way of turning himself in last week?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.96,0:18:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah! Of course!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.69,0:18:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Apparently, he stole\Nwhat's called a "data dog"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.16,0:19:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}created in an illegal experiment\Nof some research firm.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.99,0:19:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wow! What's that?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.86,0:19:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm not sure myself, but apparently{\i0}\N{\i1}it's a very intelligent pooch.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.85,0:19:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I hear that it's priceless among collectors.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.58,0:19:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's a surprise!{\i0}\N{\i1}I wanna have a dog like that!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.46,0:19:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But they say it's still missing.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.93,0:19:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wonder where it went?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.00,0:19:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Really! But now, a commercial!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.15,0:19:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.73,0:19:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there! When you're done cleaning,\Nfeed the komodo dragons!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.04,0:19:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to work your ass off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.05,0:19:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.58,0:19:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.06,0:19:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't jump on there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.00,0:19:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.66,0:19:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I said we should\Nthrow out mongrels like this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.85,0:19:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're the one that brought it here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.49,0:19:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case, we have to do\Nsomething about the ticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.75,0:20:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.42,0:20:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna salt you and eat you, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.94,0:20:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, it's time for us to go.{\i0}\N{\i1}See you next time!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.26,0:20:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good luck!{\i0}
