Dialogue: 1,0:21:21.80,0:21:30.54,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD1C4C5&\blur0.5\fade(250,250)}if it ends after the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.30,0:21:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,"Nothing is permanent." It's a fact of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.62,0:21:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The bell tolls for the great\Nones who'll someday fall. {original: "who will"}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.15,0:21:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Money makes the world go round,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.25,0:22:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but debt piles up before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.13,0:22:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I wandered through\Nall the reaches of space,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.91,0:22:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,and there I met a cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.43,0:22:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A session to the tune of an off-key melody: {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.56,0:22:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Honky Tonk Women.
